  "_comment": [
    "Plain egg class -> fertilized egg class, read from the ARK: Survival Ascended",
    "containers with scripts/../sidecar-assets (gamelist mode) rather than derived",
    "from a naming rule. The rule does not hold: _Fertilized is inserted before a",
    "variant qualifier, so Egg_Para_Bionic pairs with Egg_Para_Fertilized_Bionic,",
    "not Egg_Para_Bionic_Fertilized. Eggs with no fertilized counterpart at all",
    "(the generic Small/Medium/Large eggs, Titanoboa, Pachyrhino) are absent here",
    "on purpose, so nothing invents an item that does not exist."
